{"fluids":[],"items":[{"durability":0,"id":"item_a451ecdf0f2012069406a88175386e082ea275c98beac7b403b2971a3c9c8094","meta":0,"nbt":null,"registry":"minecraft:nesqltest:decay_fixture","tags":[]},{"durability":0,"id":"item_21ed016a39d98d17ddc11c5a2b4a1afdee5fec5a4a60f84bdfc92383979c511a","meta":2,"nbt":{"type":"compound","value":{"typed":{"type":"short","value":"9"}}},"registry":"minecraft:diamond","tags":[]}],"recipe":{"category":"category_ce2f8f2eeeb0940b9c752d4ccbe00c6269155e3d8f99754d40211eeff3355983","duration":null,"energy":null,"grid":null,"id":"recipe_6beff7e3120cc0344041ec80ba6bc0d9a174895451d2e89122baed9e3f6ef0e2","inputs":[{"choices":[{"amount":"1","consume":{"kind":"stack"},"id":"item_a451ecdf0f2012069406a88175386e082ea275c98beac7b403b2971a3c9c8094","returns":[],"rule":{"kind":"wildcard","meta":true,"nbt":false}}],"kind":"item","slot":0}],"magic":null,"notes":[{"key":"decay:scope","source":"gtPlusPlus.core.tileentities.general.TileEntityDecayablesChest.tryUpdateDecayable","text":"text_7440750245ea50a590ba51ed0352717c14986cd252ef4f55debe232ab94e4726"},{"key":"decay:scheduler","source":"gtPlusPlus.core.tileentities.general.TileEntityDecayablesChest.updateEntity","text":"text_bcc72106a5eb3c9808b5027efb6f94ff2156f08db0588429306ced1cf098427b"},{"key":"decay:progress","source":"gtPlusPlus.core.item.base.BaseItemTickable.tickItemTag","text":"text_98cb40e730abea170d67fe9aa7c30a10bd46316c0e45ecc9fc662aa7a20d7406"},{"key":"decay:replacement","source":"gtPlusPlus.core.tileentities.general.TileEntityDecayablesChest.tryUpdateDecayable","text":"text_d7cc0c602072be1ea01d16128da6c2e1f5a33ecd4d8d29d27bd642eb62dcd60f"}],"order":0,"outputs":[{"amount":"1","chance":{"denominator":"1","numerator":"1"},"change":null,"id":"item_21ed016a39d98d17ddc11c5a2b4a1afdee5fec5a4a60f84bdfc92383979c511a","kind":"item","quantity":null,"role":"result","slot":0}],"process":{"batchSteps":20,"displayedTicks":2147483647,"freshBatches":"107374183","input":"item_a451ecdf0f2012069406a88175386e082ea275c98beac7b403b2971a3c9c8094","inventoryLimit":1,"kind":"decayChest","maxTicks":2147483647,"nativeIndex":0,"nativeItem":"gtPlusPlus.core.item.materials.DustDecayable","nativeRecipe":"gtPlusPlus.core.handler.Recipes.DecayableRecipe","nativeTile":"gtPlusPlus.core.tileentities.general.TileEntityDecayablesChest","output":"item_21ed016a39d98d17ddc11c5a2b4a1afdee5fec5a4a60f84bdfc92383979c511a","replacement":"wholeStoredStackToOne","scheduler":"loadedServerInt32Modulo20","scope":"freshUntagged","version":"5.09.51.482"},"properties":{},"source":{"handler":"gtPlusPlus.nei.DecayableRecipeHandler","key":"native-decay-fresh","owner":"miscutils"}},"strings":[{"id":"text_7440750245ea50a590ba51ed0352717c14986cd252ef4f55debe232ab94e4726","locale":"zh_CN","text":"Fresh dust with no root NBT only; arbitrary metadata is accepted. Saved progress, empty root NBT and malformed NBT variants are outside this conversion contract."},{"id":"text_bcc72106a5eb3c9808b5027efb6f94ff2156f08db0588429306ced1cf098427b","locale":"zh_CN","text":"Loaded server tile updates increment a signed Java int tickCount, then run a batch when tickCount % 20 == 0. Normal batch spacing is 20 updates; signed-int wrap produces a 16-update spacing. Initial phase, unloading and lag prevent a fixed duration."},{"id":"text_98cb40e730abea170d67fe9aa7c30a10bd46316c0e45ecc9fc662aa7a20d7406","locale":"zh_CN","text":"The first batch creates TickableItem with Tick=0L, maxTick=(long)maxTicks and isActive=true. Each of at most 20 steps reads isTicking before tickItemTag. The item threshold, not the stored maxTick tag, governs deactivation; completion waits until both the last pre-step ticking flag and step result are false. Fresh input therefore needs ceil((maxTicks+2)/20) batches."},{"id":"text_d7cc0c602072be1ea01d16128da6c2e1f5a33ecd4d8d29d27bd642eb62dcd60f","locale":"zh_CN","text":"Completion replaces the entire stored input stack with exactly one copied result, without crafting container returns. Ordinary insertion clamps to one; native NBT inventory loading preserves larger stored counts. Dust onUpdate does not advance decay in ordinary player inventory."}]}